    "/deployments/{nf_deployment_id}/scale": {
      "post": {
        "description": "OPEN_ITEMS.md section 5: previously a pure stub with no state\ntransition of any kind. Scale is a replica-count change, the same\nconceptual operation as the reference's Update (RUNNING->UPDATING),\nso it drives that same edge \u2014 legal only from RUNNING.",
